Step 4: WaterService additions. Add constants for schedule duration, methods createSchedule, cancelSchedule, getChannelSchedules, getAllocationSchedules, consume, plus helpers remainingOf, toScheduleResponse, toConsumptionResponse. Add imports for new DTOs and rows.

Duration: 30–720 minutes inclusive. MINUTES * 60 * 1e9 nanos.

createSchedule:
```java
public ScheduleResponse createSchedule(String commandKey, String scheduleKey, String allocationKey,
                                       String startUtc, String endUtc) {
    requireKey("commandKey", commandKey);
    requireKey("scheduleKey", scheduleKey);
    requireKey("allocationKey", allocationKey);
    long startNanos = parseInstant("startUtc", startUtc);
    long endNanos = parseInstant("endUtc", endUtc);
    long duration = endNanos - startNanos;
    if (duration < MIN_SLOT_NANOS || duration > MAX_SLOT_NANOS) {
        throw badRequest INVALID_ARGUMENT "时段时长必须在 30 至 720 分钟之间"
    }
    String params = "SCHEDULE_CREATE|" + scheduleKey + "|" + allocationKey + "|" + startNanos + "|" + endNanos;
    return runCommand("SCHEDULE_CREATE", commandKey, params, ScheduleResponse.class, () -> {
        AllocationRow allocation = repository.findAllocationByKey(allocationKey);
        if (allocation == null) throw notFound ALLOCATION_NOT_FOUND;
        WindowRow window = lockWindowOf(allocation);
        allocation = repository.lockAllocationByKey(allocationKey);
        if (STATUS_CANCELLED.equals(allocation.status())) throw 422 SCHEDULE_NOT_ALLOWED "已取消的申请不能排班";
        BigDecimal remaining = remainingOf(allocation);
        if (remaining.signum() <= 0) throw 422 SCHEDULE_NO_REMAINING "剩余未核销水量为零，不能排班";
        if (startNanos < window.startNanos() || endNanos > window.endNanos()) throw badRequest "时段必须落在所属配水窗口内";
        if (repository.countActiveSchedulesByAllocation(allocationKey) >= MAX_ACTIVE_SLOTS) throw 422 SCHEDULE_SLOT_LIMIT;
        ScheduleRow conflict = repository.findOverlappingActiveSchedule(window.channelId(), startNanos, endNanos);
        if (conflict != null) throw conflict SCHEDULE_OVERLAP with conflict details;
        long id = repository.insertSchedule(...remaining...);
        return toScheduleResponse(repository.findScheduleByKey(scheduleKey));
    });
}
```

Wait: 422 for cancelled — spec says "排班要求该申请尚未被取消且剩余未核销水量大于零，否则422". So cancelled → 422. Use quotaExceeded-style? ApiException has quotaExceeded with fixed code QUOTA_EXCEEDED. For these 422s I need distinct codes; add a static factory `unprocessable(code, message)` to ApiException. Let me add that.

cancelSchedule:
```java
public ScheduleResponse cancelSchedule(String commandKey, String scheduleKey) {
    requireKey both;
    params = "SCHEDULE_CANCEL|" + scheduleKey;
    runCommand(... () -> {
        ScheduleRow schedule = repository.findScheduleByKey(scheduleKey);
        if (schedule == null) throw notFound SCHEDULE_NOT_FOUND;
        repository.lockWindowById(schedule.windowId()); // serialize with create on same window
        schedule = repository.findScheduleByKey(scheduleKey); // re-read
        if (STATUS_CANCELLED.equals(schedule.status())) throw conflict SCHEDULE_ALREADY_CANCELLED;
        if (nowNanos() >= schedule.startNanos()) throw conflict SCHEDULE_ALREADY_STARTED;
        repository.cancelSchedule(schedule.id(), nowNanos());
        return toScheduleResponse(repository.findScheduleByKey(scheduleKey));
    });
}
```

Hmm window could be null? windowId FK guarantees exists. lockWindowById returns row; fine.

consume:
```java
public ConsumptionResponse consume(String commandKey, String allocationKey, String amount, String occurredUtc) {
    requireKey commandKey, allocationKey;
    BigDecimal qty = parseAmount("amount", amount);
    long occurred = parseInstant("occurredUtc", occurredUtc);
    params = "CONSUMPTION|" + allocationKey + "|" + qty.toPlainString() + "|" + occurred;
    runCommand("CONSUMPTION", ..., () -> {
        AllocationRow allocation = repository.findAllocationByKey(allocationKey);
        if null 404;
        lockWindowOf(allocation);
        allocation = repository.lockAllocationByKey(allocationKey);
        List<ScheduleRow> active = repository.listActiveSchedulesByAllocation(allocationKey);
        boolean inSlot = active.stream().anyMatch(s -> s.startNanos() <= occurred && occurred < s.endNanos());
        if (!inSlot) throw 422 NO_ACTIVE_SLOT with nearest slot info;
        BigDecimal remaining = remainingOf(allocation);
        if (qty.compareTo(remaining) > 0) throw quotaExceeded(...);
        long id = repository.insertConsumption(...);
        ConsumptionRow row = repository.findConsumptionById(id);
        return toConsumptionResponse(row, remaining.subtract(qty));
    });
}
```

Nearest slot message: pick min by distance. Define distance: if occurred < start → start - occurred; else occurred - end. Pick min. Message: "用水时刻不在任何生效时段内，最近可用时段: [startIso, endIso)". If no active slots at all: "该申请没有生效时段".

remainingOf: allocation.heldAmount().subtract(repository.sumConsumedAmount(allocation.allocationKey())).

